 sequenceDiagram
      actor U as Usuari (kitchen_manager/admin)
      participant B as Navegador
      participant R as Router
      participant C as IngredientsController
      participant M as Ingredient
      participant IR as IngredientRestriction

      U->>B: Omple formulari (nom + N restriccions)
      B->>R: POST /ingredients (name, restriction_ids[])
      R->>C: #create
      C->>C: require_kitchen_manager_or_above!
      C->>M: Ingredient.new(ingredient_params)
      M-->>C: @ingredient
      C->>M: @ingredient.save
      M->>M: save (persisteix ingredient)
      loop per cada restriction_id
          M->>IR: create(this.id, restriction_id)
      end
      IR-->>M: ok
      M-->>C: true
      C-->>B: 302 redirect ? /ingredients (flash notice)
      B-->>U: Llista d'ingredients